name 00texlive.installation
category TLCore
depend opt_location:https://mirror.ctan.org/systems/texlive/tlnet
depend setting_available_architectures:
depend setting_usertree:1

name algorithmicx
category Package
revision 78101
shortdesc The algorithmic style you always wanted
longdesc Algorithmicx provides a flexible, yet easy to use, way for
longdesc inserting good looking pseudocode or source code in your
longdesc papers. It has built in support for Pseudocode, Pascal and C,
longdesc and offers powerful means to create definitions for any
longdesc programming language. The user can adapt a Pseudocode style to
longdesc his native language.
containersize 7708
containerchecksum f3f66dcbc7d8e361cb1c1fc6dff51c1174e6dc369323915b62bdff75f73264737aed5374f90abb149973d67b8c6fb21c07ce39ec9e5c9e60e0001035098d3d8e
